  Quote of the Week:

  Imperial Motto of Frederick III (1415-1493), Holy Roman Emperor and ruler 
of Austria:
  "The whole world is subject to Austria"


ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:


  In spring, Prometeo rode into Shasta.

  Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0)'s minions initiated a campaign of 
conquest directed at Shasta, a Mountain province owing allegiance to 
Prometeo.  Tlazolteotl (#88) was in command of the attacking armies.  The 
defending forces were commanded by the provincial Eagle chieftain.  The 
armies were drawn up into lines of battle as shown here:

  ATTACKING ARMY, Battle of Shasta (0304):

  222nd   
 Phalanx  
