  DEFENDING ARMY

  Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll stood ready at the head of his 
thousands.  I marched with my loyal troops, jaws set in terrible 
determination.
  The Skeletal Armies led by Uga-Buga Makumb marched into battle with a 
fanatical fervor.  Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll strode forward and 
challenged me to personal combat.  I refused to enter personal combat.
  The forces commanded by me were disappointed by my faint-heartedness.  
They marched on, though with lessened confidence.  Luckily, Uga-Buga Makumb 
managed to convince a savage native tribe to surprise me with their fleet 
footed skirmishers.  With this help, Uga-Buga Makumb gained an important 
advantage.  Also, his wise tactical planning assured his forces an 
undeniable advantage.

  On the right outside flank, the Veteran 71st Skeletal Legion were arrayed 
against the 160th Legion.  The 315th Dragons soared over the 160th Legion 
and attacked them.  The 71st Skeletal Legion battled with the 160th Legion 
and smashed their skulls as if they were eggplants.
  In the interior front, the Veteran 316th Bowmen faced the 168th 
Heavy Cavalry.  The 316th Bowmen battled the 168th Heavy Cavalry and mowed 
them down like weeds.
  Within the interior lines, the Veteran 317th Trolls were overflown by the 
Circle of Wraiths, who urged them into mindless fanatical battle-lust with 
their maniacal laughter.  They faced the 199th Heavy Cavalry.  The 293rd 
Dragons soared over the 199th Heavy Cavalry and attacked them.  The 317th 
Trolls fought the 199th Heavy Cavalry and smashed them like rotten tomatoes.
  On the left wing, the 154th Skeletal Legion were arrayed against the 152nd 
Legion.  The 314th Dragons swooped down on the 152nd Legion and attacked 
them.  The 154th Skeletal Legion battled with the 152nd Legion and smashed 
their heads as if they were eggshells.
  Uga-Buga Makumb's great horde overwhelmed the army of Prometeo and took 
the field, dispersing their enemies.  The 71st Skeletal Legion scattered the 
160th Legion in all directions.  The 316th Bowmen slew the 168th 
Heavy Cavalry almost to a man.  The 317th Trolls demolished the 199th 
Heavy Cavalry.  The 154th Skeletal Legion annihilated the 152nd Legion.
  Belladonna was overrun by the forces of Uga-Buga Makumb.  My forces 
completely dispersed, I escaped alone to Marzuq.
  During fall, I journeyed to Shasta.
  The fall darkened into early winter.  Girard's attempted cast of the 
Plague spell was unsuccessful.

  Thy humble servant,   Girard


